The '''Phantom Spirit''' is a [[Spooky Mobs|Spooky Mob]], found only in places such as the [[Graveyard]], [[Wilderness]], [[Spider's Den]], and [[Obsidian Sanctuary]]. This mob runs at the player and attacks rapidly. It copies the player's [[Armor]], [[mcw:Skin|Skin]], and [[Weapon]].

