==Trivia == 
*There was a glitch where, if the player were to use a [[Sword]] with the {{Ench|Thunderlord}} [[Enchantment]], the [[mcw:Lightning|Lightning]] strike would instantly kill the Phantom Spirit similar to dealing {{Stat|True Damage}}, ignoring all its {{Stat|defense}}.
*When it transforms, it does not copy the player's Weapon and Armor [[Stats]].
**However, the Thorns enchantment will still function on the '''Phantom Spirit''', if the player has it on their armor.
*Both {{MobSprite|Timestalk Clone}} and '''Phantom Spirit''' take the skin of the player. The former upon spawning, while the latter when attacking a player.
